{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":["第 一 章 總則"],"text":"本標準依自來水法第五十條第二項規定訂定之。","id":"J0110036/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"0f70e119f42c92e1dd67ea3f55a9cf735deb9f4710c8a15879a78345d6e5a3ed","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:1/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":21,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":["第 一 章 總則"],"text":"本標準所稱之用戶管線，包括下列各款：\n一、進水管：由配水管至水量計間之管線。\n二、受水管：由水量計至建築物內之管線。\n三、分水支管：由受水管分出之給水管及支管。\n四、與衛生設備之連接水管。","id":"J0110036/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"936218d45897e1aabb9ae514f21c8334399b9057372f36b6badc122232cb8fcf","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:2/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":94,"children":[{"id":"J0110036/a:2/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":19,"end":39,"children":[]},{"id":"J0110036/a:2/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":39,"end":59,"children":[]},{"id":"J0110036/a:2/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":59,"end":81,"children":[]},{"id":"J0110036/a:2/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":81,"end":94,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":["第 二 章 設計"],"text":"用戶管線之設計，應依據所裝設之各種設備種類、數量及用途，計算其最大用水量；其口徑大小須足以在配水管之設計最低水壓時，仍能充分供應需要之用水量為準。","id":"J0110036/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"86a330696ad098e58ffe77a204c302d2a375975c797caf49a69cf51e18b65801","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:3/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":73,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":["第 二 章 設計"],"text":"衛生設備用水量設計基準如附表一，其同時使用之百分比設計基準如附表二。","id":"J0110036/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"01189db423885f525d85b486f682e03a99df1e14c36573599c610d35210812c9","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:4/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":34,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":["第 二 章 設計"],"text":"進水管及受水管之口徑，應足以輸送該建築物尖峰時所需之水量，並不得小於十九公厘。","id":"J0110036/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"0c643a70dbab1b3808d764724d7523d7da339f72ca7fbb670b2ecc5d3e9432eb","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:5/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":39,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":["第 二 章 設計"],"text":"蓄水池與水塔應為水密性構造物，且應設置適當之人孔、通氣管及溢排水設備；池（塔）底並應設坡度為五十分之一以上之洩水坡。\n蓄水池容量應為設計用水量十分之二以上；其與水塔容量合計應為設計用水量十分之四以上至二日用水量以下，並需符合自來水事業所訂基準值。\n前項基準值由自來水事業訂定及公告，並報請主管機關備查。\n蓄水池之牆壁及平頂應與其他結構物分開，並應保持四十五公分以上之距離；池底需與接觸地層之基礎分離，並設置長、寬各三十公分以上，深度五公分以上之集水坑。\n進水口低於地面之蓄水池，其受水管口徑五十公厘以上者，應設置地上式接水槽或持壓閥。","id":"J0110036/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"cc4840f7b8583316d1d7f612ca7cfeafbdb108a0036788d4dca2f99c327fa37c","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:6/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":59,"children":[]},{"id":"J0110036/a:6/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":59,"end":124,"children":[]},{"id":"J0110036/a:6/p:3","kind":"paragraph","number":3,"start":124,"end":152,"children":[]},{"id":"J0110036/a:6/p:4","kind":"paragraph","number":4,"start":152,"end":227,"children":[]},{"id":"J0110036/a:6/p:5","kind":"paragraph","number":5,"start":227,"end":267,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 7 條","path":["第 二 章 設計"],"text":"用戶裝置之蓄水池、水塔及其他各種設備之最高水位，應與受水管保留五公分以上間隙，避免回吸所致之污染。","id":"J0110036/a:7","anchor":"a-7","contentHash":"c7bf045bfb2e06f73c233873bb4029d0a9ba7380967358561740c55401882821","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:7/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":49,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 8 條","path":["第 二 章 設計"],"text":"採用沖水閥之便器應具有效之消除真空設備。","id":"J0110036/a:8","anchor":"a-8","contentHash":"f369c91cd88e043a0393363c928334c7e438943a253ae4f5f24dab65f9dbbb7b","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:8/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":20,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 9 條","path":["第 二 章 設計"],"text":"衛生設備連接水管之口徑不得小於下列規定：\n一、洗面盆：十公厘。\n二、浴缸：十三公厘。\n三、蓮篷頭：十三公厘。\n四、小便器：十三公厘。\n五、水洗馬桶（水箱式）：十公厘。\n六、水洗馬桶（沖水閥式）：二十五公厘。\n七、飲水器：十公厘。\n八、水栓：十三公厘。\n前項各款以外之裝置，其口徑按用水量決定之。","id":"J0110036/a:9","anchor":"a-9","contentHash":"00c44c330806bb13642a4b7dd824a1cf7e1c284f78ed6d58946a72b04f2a50fb","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:9/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":126,"children":[{"id":"J0110036/a:9/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":21,"end":32,"children":[]},{"id":"J0110036/a:9/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":32,"end":43,"children":[]},{"id":"J0110036/a:9/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":43,"end":55,"children":[]},{"id":"J0110036/a:9/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":55,"end":67,"children":[]},{"id":"J0110036/a:9/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":67,"end":84,"children":[]},{"id":"J0110036/a:9/p:1/i:6","kind":"item","number":6,"start":84,"end":104,"children":[]},{"id":"J0110036/a:9/p:1/i:7","kind":"item","number":7,"start":104,"end":115,"children":[]},{"id":"J0110036/a:9/p:1/i:8","kind":"item","number":8,"start":115,"end":126,"children":[]}]},{"id":"J0110036/a:9/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":126,"end":147,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 10 條","path":["第 二 章 設計"],"text":"水量計之口徑應視用水量及水壓決定，但不得小於十三公厘；其受水方所裝設之水閥，口徑應與受水管口徑相同。","id":"J0110036/a:10","anchor":"a-10","contentHash":"e8dc1731287311799508fac42ab1d77efd33b325d40ed8da3ccdc14e6a3e4e71","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:10/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":50,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 11 條","path":["第 二 章 設計"],"text":"二層樓以上或供兩戶以上使用之建築物，用戶管線應分層分戶各自裝設水閥。","id":"J0110036/a:11","anchor":"a-11","contentHash":"748802dbd2d0741bd25766a01777fb3f40d1f0120603e286d0743f69bd8f03a3","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:11/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":34,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 12 條","path":["第 二 章 設計"],"text":"連接熱水器、洗衣機或洗碗機之水管，應裝設水閥；必要時，並應裝設逆止閥。","id":"J0110036/a:12","anchor":"a-12","contentHash":"2d50e9b2a7a74831855ff332cf981b6f99018206870561e444b5bfc228ff6e58","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:12/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":35,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 13 條","path":["第 二 章 設計"],"text":"水栓及衛生設備供水水壓不得低於每平方公分○．三公斤；其因特殊裝置需要高壓或採用直接沖洗閥者，水壓不得低於每平方公分一公斤。\n水壓未達前項規定者，應備自動控制之壓力水箱、蓄水池或加壓設施。","id":"J0110036/a:13","anchor":"a-13","contentHash":"0958b07629c3ab6e6771e6a59f812b1ecb67e5a6cae65293898598c98941235c","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:13/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":62,"children":[]},{"id":"J0110036/a:13/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":62,"end":93,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 14 條","path":["第 二 章 設計"],"text":"用戶裝設之抽水機，不得由受水管直接抽水。","id":"J0110036/a:14","anchor":"a-14","contentHash":"5be558ac8073878957e64b368cedc5ffa208edd3fe9f1bc44e8c89d8081eebe9","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:14/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":20,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 15 條","path":["第 二 章 設計"],"text":"蓄水池、消防蓄水池或游泳池等之供水，應採跌水式；其進水管之出口，應高出溢水面一管徑以上，且不得小於五十公厘。","id":"J0110036/a:15","anchor":"a-15","contentHash":"b114dbea40bf8f5b36ee1a9217da4482d9de88635a09cb704cfc39db605e413d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:15/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":54,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 16 條","path":["第 二 章 設計"],"text":"裝有盛水器之衛生設備，其溢水面與自來水出口之間隙，應依前條之規定辦理。\n無法維持前項間隙時，應於手動控制閥之前端，裝置逆止閥。","id":"J0110036/a:16","anchor":"a-16","contentHash":"e1f3d58b8412a1b763872fa02118a85ef1e4c6354142247fc5d21848ada46b53","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:16/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":36,"children":[]},{"id":"J0110036/a:16/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":36,"end":63,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 17 條","path":["第 二 章 設計"],"text":"裝接軟管用之水栓或衛生設備，應裝設逆止閥，並高出最高用水點十五公分以上；未裝設逆止閥之水栓或衛生設備，不得裝接軟管。","id":"J0110036/a:17","anchor":"a-17","contentHash":"2d8f70bb26892b03ded460c2b4f1b523e63bf1a641cb73a7c7e5922f9e5e8950","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:17/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":58,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 18 條","path":["第 二 章 設計"],"text":"自來水與非自來水系統應完全分開。","id":"J0110036/a:18","anchor":"a-18","contentHash":"757baca8eb85c6c8e75b375aad6cb2822e4d766b52807bb08d8f2cae41389815","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:18/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":16,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 19 條","path":["第 三 章 器材"],"text":"用戶管線與其管件及衛生設備，其有國際標準或國家標準者，應從其規定；其中衛生設備最大使用水量，如附表三。","id":"J0110036/a:19","anchor":"a-19","contentHash":"a300f9250abcc8d2eb205ba2af669d772bcb73446d79c37cc8bd56c9e07a6b8a","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:19/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":51,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 20 條","path":["第 三 章 器材"],"text":"曾用於非自來水之舊管，不得使用為自來水管。","id":"J0110036/a:20","anchor":"a-20","contentHash":"0c60e91628c693c54efb7c1a0384a6c8c89b573f2b38c63b08c1cca726e9b1c9","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:20/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":21,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 21 條","path":["第 四 章 施工"],"text":"埋設於地下之用戶管線，與排水或污水管溝渠之水平距離不得小於三十公分，並須以未經掘動或壓實之泥土隔離之；其與排水溝或污水管相交者，應在排水溝或污水管之頂上或溝底通過。","id":"J0110036/a:21","anchor":"a-21","contentHash":"b2f1c07fb7ee2bcde6804e5d7fe1573232f0fd0154168f86b96baa4da1f387e3","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:21/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":82,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 22 條","path":["第 四 章 施工"],"text":"用戶管線及排水或污水管需埋設於同一管溝時，應符合下列規定：\n一、用戶管線之底，全段須高出排水或污水管最高點三十公分以上。\n二、用戶管線及排水或污水管所使用接頭，均為水密性之構造，其接頭應減至最少數。","id":"J0110036/a:22","anchor":"a-22","contentHash":"5107d0f15d374f4e8fd10c260c466e5f385130a53f4cc982f5be2a041571d1ff","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:22/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":99,"children":[{"id":"J0110036/a:22/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":30,"end":61,"children":[]},{"id":"J0110036/a:22/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":61,"end":99,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 23 條","path":["第 四 章 施工"],"text":"用戶管線埋設深度應考量其安全；必要時，應加保護設施。","id":"J0110036/a:23","anchor":"a-23","contentHash":"d6ce16bc90591e2eed48e9a3317d9897a6fd1be5c7218de54c4ebd0e6d5ad559","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:23/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":26,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 24 條","path":["第 四 章 施工"],"text":"用戶管線橫向或豎向暴露部分，應在接頭處或適當間隔處，以鐵件加以吊掛固定，並容許其伸縮。","id":"J0110036/a:24","anchor":"a-24","contentHash":"663707ddb9687857f07fc014080068378c67ce7bf983f82ffa5b7026256c36f1","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:24/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":43,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 25 條","path":["第 四 章 施工"],"text":"用水設備之安裝，不得損及建築物之安全；裝設於六樓以上建築物結構體內之水管，應設置專用管道。","id":"J0110036/a:25","anchor":"a-25","contentHash":"d58345bd23c8e03f8a3134cba71770b45013d99209c87a901693b61401d2f957","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:25/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":45,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 26 條","path":["第 四 章 施工"],"text":"用水設備不得與電線、電纜、煤氣管及油管相接觸，並不得置於可能使其被污染之物質或液體中。","id":"J0110036/a:26","anchor":"a-26","contentHash":"e005d1c53c8a62123325bbf0ae5db14cb14ca4bf3848226517ae7a70dd045afa","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:26/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":43,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 27 條","path":["第 四 章 施工"],"text":"水量計應裝置於不受污染損壞且易於抄讀之地點；其裝置於地面下者，應設水表箱，並須排水良好。","id":"J0110036/a:27","anchor":"a-27","contentHash":"77d71ef38169450352367b71363d4d2221f2132393b239a105a3bd2150a33c9d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:27/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":44,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 28 條","path":["第 四 章 施工"],"text":"配水管裝設接合管間隔應在三十公分以上，且其管徑不得大於配水管徑二分之一。","id":"J0110036/a:28","anchor":"a-28","contentHash":"7389e61292fc81798a9eaa488d88fb7878ab0b846d1c85c25c2877a6ff7d7c77","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:28/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":36,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 29 條","path":["第 四 章 施工"],"text":"採用丁字管裝接進水管時，其進水管之管徑，不得大於配水管。","id":"J0110036/a:29","anchor":"a-29","contentHash":"0fcd83530c65c2f70806a63fca03ce384e6e2801c85f4c290df37636601f7d6c","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:29/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":28,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 30 條","path":["第 五 章 檢驗"],"text":"用水設備之新建或因擴建、改裝導致原用水量需求改變時，應於施工前將設計書送請當地自來水事業核准。","id":"J0110036/a:30","anchor":"a-30","contentHash":"ef1b79d7842ac5dab656850c9fe681e9089ab3bacc8d978dbc5848142f41f4bd","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:30/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":47,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 31 條","path":["第 五 章 檢驗"],"text":"用戶管線裝妥，在未澆置混凝土之前，自來水管承裝商應施行壓力試驗；其試驗水壓為每平方公分十公斤，試驗時間必須六十分鐘以上不漏水為合格。","id":"J0110036/a:31","anchor":"a-31","contentHash":"2729a9ccbfebccd3f096388f4e05d1a9b3f0961c4e005fb299b8629532e7fbf9","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:31/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":66,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 32 條","path":["第 六 章 附則"],"text":"本標準自發布日施行。","id":"J0110036/a:32","anchor":"a-32","contentHash":"0760487a7e1a3f98a433704c163a939df3ca09942ff350f224457b344857930a","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0110036/a:32/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":10,"children":[]}]}}],"attachments":[{"title":"附表一衛生設備用水量設計基準.PDF","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000234044"},{"title":"附表一衛生設備用水量設計基準.DOC","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000041260"},{"title":"附表二衛生設備同時使用之百分比設計基準.PDF","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000233188"},{"title":"附表二衛生設備同時使用之百分比設計基準.DOC","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000009395"},{"title":"附表三衛生設備最大使用水量標準.PDF","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000234045"},{"title":"附表三衛生設備最大使用水量標準.DOC","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000041261"}],"category":"建築與設計","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"1.中華民國九十二年八月十三日經濟部經水字第 09204610150  號令訂定\n  發布全文 32 條；並自發布日施行\n2.中華民國九十六年二月十三日經濟部經水字第 09604600870  號令修正\n  發布第 9、19、30  條條文級第 4  條條文之附表一\n3.中華民國一百零五年六月六日經濟部經水字第 10504602540  號令修正\n  發布第 6  條條文","id":"J0110036","keywords":[],"kind":"法規命令","modified":"2016-06-06","name":"自來水用戶用水設備標準","region":"中央","source":"全國法規資料庫","status":"來源未標廢止","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=J0110036","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","snapshot":"2026/9/18 上午 12:00:00","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"d8d7993a754d101dfd23d04f69f3858e0605a4ea9e716802d0320f7d809f2945","sourceRecordId":"CM","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"2016-06-06","effectiveDate":""}}